{"seq":3,"slug":"management-philosophy","title":"经营哲学体系","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/core-contributions/management-philosophy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"philosophy-as-foundation","title":"哲学作为经营的根基","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/core-contributions/management-philosophy/philosophy-as-foundation","wordCount":1410,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"seiwajuku-and-passing-on","title":"盛和塾与哲学的传承","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/core-contributions/management-philosophy/seiwajuku-and-passing-on","wordCount":1405,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 经营哲学体系\n\n本章呈现稻盛和夫以哲学为根基的经营智慧。稻盛和夫将\"哲学\"确立为经营的根基，以\"作为人何谓正确\"为准则，以共同的哲学凝聚人心。他还创办盛和塾，将经营哲学无私地传承下去。两篇文档，分别呈现哲学作为经营根基的智慧，以及盛和塾与哲学传承的实践。\n"}